</p>

<h4>CONTACTING US</h4>

<p>
  If you contact us by email or phone, we process the data you give us (your name, email address or phone number, and
  the content of your message) only to answer your enquiry. The legal basis is
  taking steps at your request before entering into a contract (Article 6(1)(b) GDPR) and our legitimate interest in
  answering enquiries (Article 6(1)(f) GDPR).
</p>

<p>
  We do not keep this data in a database, only as email messages. We do not use it for marketing or profiling, and we
  do not share it with third parties without your consent unless the law requires it. We keep messages for a maximum
  of 3 years and then delete them.
</p>

<h4>LINKS TO OTHER WEBSITES</h4>

<p>
  The website contains links to Facebook, Instagram and Google Maps. When you click a link, you leave our website and
  the privacy policy of that service applies.
</p>

<h4>YOUR RIGHTS</h4>

<p>Under the GDPR, you have the right to:</p>

<ul>
  <li>access your personal data (Article 15),</li>
  <li>have inaccurate data corrected (Article 16),</li>
  <li>have your data erased (Article 17),</li>
  <li>restrict processing (Article 18),</li>
  <li>data portability (Article 20),</li>
  <li>object to processing based on legitimate interest (Article 21).</li>
</ul>

<p>
  You can send a request to <a href="mailto:drvenival@gmail.com" class="underline">drvenival@gmail.com</a>, and we
  will reply within one month. You also have the right to lodge a complaint with the Croatian Personal Data Protection
  Agency (AZOP,
  <a href="https://azop.hr" class="underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">azop.hr</a>) or with the
  supervisory authority in your EU country of residence.
</p>

